# Normalise line endings: this repo is developed on Windows and built on Linux
# CI, and `forceConsistentCasingInFileNames`/LF mismatches were a real hazard.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
